    <title>中国文坛打假往事：学术特权和民间鉴抄 E.108</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a577f17016dcc7e0542b123</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a577f17016dcc7e0542b123</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 Jul 2026 13:01:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2006年，还是公共知识分子的韩寒说过，文坛是个屁。</span></p><p><span>文坛不是个屁。和大多数组织一样，文坛有自己的利益所在。</span></p><p><span>回顾这些年的新闻，我们可以很轻易地发现发现，几乎所有的造假都和利益绑定在一起。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg06H8Pkj7tO6IBGI0xwT9Jog_oM.png"><p><strong><span>🕕时间线：</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">0:31</a> 蒋方舟被学术打假来龙去脉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">7:22</a> 郭敬明的抄袭和道歉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a> 蒋方舟的天才作家往事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a> 贾浅浅的文学争议和特权</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> 今年普遍发生的文坛抄袭风波</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a> 大学与作协</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1888">31:28</a> 另一面：打假者的类型</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">35:25</a> 消费者的钱和时间</span></p><p><strong><span>📖相关内容：</span></strong></p><p><span>《东京八平米》吉井忍</span></p><p><a href="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_33588998" data-url="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_33588998"><span>还原蒋方舟论文风波：促成逆转的“新线索”到底是什么？</span></a></p><p><a href="http://www.chinawriter.com" data-url="http://www.chinawriter.com"><span>2026年作协预算</span></a></p><p></p><p><strong><span>🙋听友群：heishi121</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>🫱加入</span></strong><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/AN7OWkLXYy2" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/AN7OWkLXYy2"><strong><span>降噪舱NoiseOff年度阅读计划</span></strong></a></p><p><strong><span>🎧订阅</span></strong><a href="https://xiaobot.net/p/zwbkyysc" data-url="https://xiaobot.net/p/zwbkyysc"><strong><span>《中文播客运营手册》</span></strong></a></p><p><span>封面图片 Made by Gemini</span></p>]]></description>
